  "description": "Phoenix All Suites Hotels offer the luxury of a condo with the amenities of a hotel. Our two hotels offer friendly service, condo-style amenities, convenient locations with direct beach access and unforgettable memories. One-bedroom suites with fully-equipped kitchens in both Gulf Shores hotels on the beach overlooking the Gulf of Mexico. Each suite features a King size bed, sofa sleeper and bunk beds for young children, with one and one half baths offering all the conveniences of home. Each of the Gulf Shores' hotels on the beach have balconies that overlook the Gulf of Mexico. Amenities include covered parking, outdoor pool, kiddie pool, and on site laundry room. Each suite is provided with one parking spot. Free Wi-Fi throughout condos and in lobby. Handicap Accessible.",
